      "text": "\n\nTortuguero introduces you to Costa Rica's Caribbean landscapes and waterways. Around Arenal, you can see the rainforest from different heights, walk across lava fields and relax in hot springs. At Manuel Antonio, the forest comes right up to the white-sand beaches. Along the trails, you may see monkeys, sloths, birds, reptiles and butterflies.\n"
